# runtime: it dereferences the host platform's libgfortran version and then
# dlopens libgcc_s/libgfortran/libstdc++/libgomp by their glibc-era file names.
# Termux builds Julia with clang against Android's libc++ and none of those names
# exists in the prefix, so the stub aborted the stdlib precompile with
#	FieldError: type Nothing has no field `major`
# at pkgimage.mk:28 (run 37876520515).
